# Guitar Freaks 8th Mix power-up ver.: a game, from what gtrfrk8m-install.his left (its NVRAM). NOTE 605 (RTC-RAM cleared): Test
# goes on; the boot checks, the warning and the title. Two coins, then Start every 300 frames
# through the mode and music select (their defaults), the first stage played with no input to
# GAME OVER, and attract again. Hashes the main RAM every frame, snapshots every 60 frames.
game gtrfrk8m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 900 press "Service Mode" 8
at 9000 press "Coin 1" 8
at 9060 press "Coin 1" 8
from 9300 every 300 press "1 Player Start" 8
from 0 every 60 snap
at 18000 quit
